---
import FeatureIcon from "../FeatureIcon.astro";
import Mark from "../../Mark.astro";
---
<div class="question-bubble"><span class="question-initial">Q</span><span>When are our annual dues due?</span></div>
<div class="sheet answer-sheet"><div class="answer-heading"><Mark size={22} /><span class="paper-title">Answer from your documents</span></div><p>Annual dues are due on <strong>January 1.</strong></p><div class="source-reference"><FeatureIcon name="documents" /><span>Declaration · Page 6</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div></div>
<div class="source-connector"></div>
<div class="source-page"><div class="source-page-top"><span>Declaration</span><span>06</span></div><strong class="source-title">Annual assessments</strong><p>“The annual assessment shall be <mark>due and payable on the first day of January.</mark>”</p><span class="source-rule"></span><span class="source-rule short"></span></div>
